## 7. AI Policy Engine & Multi-LLM Pipeline

```typescript
// Prompt synthesis input contract
interface PolicyGenerationInput {
  framework: 'SOC 2' | 'HIPAA' | 'GDPR';
  companyName: string;
  industry: string;
  cloudProvider: string;
  dataTypes: string[];
  teamSize: string;
}
```

The system sends structured prompts to **OpenRouter API** (`meta-llama/llama-3.1-70b-instruct`). If offline or without an API key, the built-in **AI Compliance Synthesizer** generates a complete 4-section policy:
- **Purpose & Scope:** tailored to cloud provider (AWS / Supabase).
- **Data Classification:** tailored to sensitive data types.
- **Mandated Technical Controls:** CC6.1 Logical Access, TLS 1.3, AES-256, MFA.
- **Incident Response & Monitoring:** audit logging SLAs.

