## 8. Backend REST API Endpoint Specifications

| Method | Route | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `GET` | `/api/health` | Service status, connected providers (Clerk, Supabase, AI, Stripe) |
| `GET` | `/api/policies` | Fetch user policies from Supabase with RLS |
