| `GET` | `/api/controls` | Retrieve control matrix items & evidence links |
| `PATCH` | `/api/controls/:id` | Update control status & attach evidence proof |
| `GET` | `/api/checklists` | Fetch audit prep checklist items |
| `GET` | `/api/score` | Compute overall compliance readiness score (0-100%) |
| `POST` | `/api/assistant/chat` | AI Copilot Q&A chatbot endpoint |
| `POST` | `/api/stripe/create-checkout-session` | Generate Stripe subscription checkout link |

